<title>MALAYSIA: Ringgit slips on profit-taking, peso news.</title>
<headline>Ringgit slips on profit-taking, peso news.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Previous	Forecast	Resistance    Support</p>
<p>    2.4865/5036   2.4900/5000   2.4850	  2.5050</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>* Ringgit slips on profit-taking and dollar covering ahead of weekend</p>
<p>* News that peso allowed to fluctuate in a wider range had spillover effect on ringgit</p>
<p>* Offshore players sell dollar/ringgit at 2.4980</p>
<p>The ringgit slipped in early in early Asian trading on profit-taking and news that the Philippines central bank would allow the peso to move in a wider range against the dollar, dealers said.</p>
</text>
